OL,3,GNEWSADFDS expands schedule for 2027
OL,4,AJersey-Poole route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry company will launch its
OL,7,FJersey-Poole fast ferry service more
OL,8,Fthan five weeks earlier next year and
OL,9,Fadd 50 sailings amid what is describes
OL,10,Fas strong growth in passenger numbers.
OL,12,FDFDS plans to start the service on 24
OL,13,FMarch rather than 1 May, giving
OL,14,Fislanders a direct high-speed
OL,15,Fconnection to the UK over Easter.
OL,17,FThe 2027 schedule includes 130 return
OL,18,Ftrips, 25 more than this year, with
OL,19,Fpassenger numbers on the Poole route
OL,20,Fhaving risen 21% year-on-year.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
