OL,3,GNEWSADFDS expands schedule for 2027
OL,4,AJersey-Poole route
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoute Director for Jersey at DFDS Chris
OL,7,FParker said the company had "used what
OL,8,Fwe have learned during 2026, together
OL,9,Fwith feedback from our customers" to
OL,10,Fshape the services for next year.
